📊 Sales Data Analysis Using Python
🔍 Project Overview

This project analyzes a raw sales dataset from Kaggle to identify sales trends, top-performing products, regional performance, and actionable business insights using Python.

📁 Dataset

Source: Kaggle (Superstore Sales Dataset)

File: sales_data.csv

🛠 Tools & Libraries

Python

Pandas



Matplotlib

🔄 Data Cleaning Steps

Inspected data structure and data types

Handled missing values in Sales, Profit, and Discount

Removed duplicate records

Converted Order Date to datetime format

Created new columns:

Cost = Sales − Profit

Month from Order Date

📈 Analysis Performed

Total sales and profit by month

Top 5 products by sales

Sales by region

Outlier detection using IQR method

📊 Visualizations

Monthly Sales Trend (Line Chart)

Sales by Region (Bar Chart)

💡 Key Business Insights

Sales show seasonal trends across months

A small set of products contributes most of the revenue

Regional sales performance varies significantly

